":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"すごい。田舎なのもあって学業の方は進研ゼミだけだったので。","ts":"1636634919.207700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SLx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"529529d9-ecfc-4b77-90c0-455c07bc064d","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"番台予備校かな？(大喜利","ts":"1636634675.206600","edited":{"user":"U06ECBRTJ","ts":"1636634788.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3RA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97a27502-4a0d-43bd-9c2b-975f389dbed9","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"夏期(冬季)講習とか普通に 10～20 飛んでいきます。","ts":"1636634649.206200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m9oyw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E5397DE9-EF0D-427C-B6E7-256A0B4A9C44","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"予備校高そう","ts":"1636634562.205600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gjc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9fee76d2-c480-49c8-a9ac-ec5012c0e931","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"それに増して息子がいてる○台予備校のお金が信じられないほど高い。","ts":"1636634540.205300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yc2D4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91152610-C08B-476A-82AF-C5771E11CD30","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"僕も習い事多めだったので、週5で何かありましたね。野球が1番時間使ってだのは間違いないけど、今考えると忙しい中で友達と遊ぶ予定を入れて充実してたのかもしれない。","ts":"1636634488.204400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5t8F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66de0dc7-a341-4289-ad72-5da026d461af","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"うちが行ってる習字はコスパがかなり良い。月に2000円。","ts":"1636634488.204300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"smL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2469017a-40a9-466c-bf0b-afda106aa99a","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"親が辛い。送り迎えと習い事代が辛い。","ts":"1636634441.202700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rmje"}]},{"client_msg_id":"180f09aa-b962-4a62-8be6-69486cceb556","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"もうそれだけで辛そう。","ts":"1636634413.201400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zT5tw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8598f9f6-6426-4988-af36-44d2b530ba72","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"女の子は習い事の数をステータスにしてる子もいますからね。","ts":"1636634391.200500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VQbJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"781747eb-796f-46ca-b7e7-cd843b0ae163","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あー、一時期、水泳もやってたな。","ts":"1636634335.199100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FpBtw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c84f2e3-f0af-4cb3-b35b-55462a60f299","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"楽しめてるなら全然いいんですが。","ts":"1636634317.198800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+B+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a204956-4209-44b8-ba1b-5582df3b2b64","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"現代のお子さんの習い事数すごいですね。そろばんと水泳しかしてなかった。","ts":"1636634303.198400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tbXn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4ec7cdf-c951-44d9-b9b9-694b8b31a693","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"娘はピアノ、そろばん、バレエ、絵画、習字をやってました。今はそろばんとバレエはやめましたが。","ts":"1636634204.197500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"54Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b3b9ff2-3742-4336-a363-a29fe2a59333","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"習い事、結構行ってますからねぇ。","ts":"1636634154.196700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Dv=l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"528C6BFA-F510-4249-AA66-E902D7FE827A","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"mattnさん、Tシャツの件といい、習い事のヘンテコエピソードが豊富ですねw\n","ts":"1636634130.196300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n337T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d21b575-b8b6-42f8-b7ea-b96aa9138538","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"娘を迎えにいく途中だったので、家に引き返すわけにもいかず、習い事の先生に血だらけの姿を見られ「えーっ！！」と","ts":"1636634034.194800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cUKj4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e31bf9c3-13e8-417b-b519-155341d0b1d2","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あ、いやそうではないんですが、少なくとも半年前に血だらけになったのは知ってます。","ts":"1636633995.193800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7ca"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5dee63be-2663-42ab-bb7f-a1a3d1256622","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"奥さんとは高校生のころからのお知り合いなんですね。","ts":"1636633964.193000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yc5WO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"292b48bd-24a8-4cbb-aaef-e4c02d11ab74","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ママチャリで立ちこぎしてたらペダルがスコンと壊れてそのまま地面に落下。","ts":"1636633950.192700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L6ro"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca28f6b4-757b-4778-80ce-cd2924260eb8","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"今日、奥さんとそんな話をしていて\n僕「こんなこけたの高校生ぶりとちゃうか？」\n妻「いや、半年前に自転車でコケてめっちゃ出血したやん」\n僕「そうでした」\nという会話をしました。","ts":"1636633910.191800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MkqVi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"634c3206-2041-4c53-8988-d99eabaca230","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"たしかに直近でいつこけたか記憶にないですね。","ts":"1636633750.190300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WrO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a422733a-d0c0-4f7e-87d8-6f2ee70bc72e","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"こけるってかなり危険な状態ですからね","ts":"1636633502.189600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"chzb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd4007e8-3c35-43cf-9a34-c0a66ba18887","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"アスファルト、体を切り付けながら～、暗闇走りぬける～","ts":"1636633327.188600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fuita","count":6,"users":["U76GA7MFA","U81LLJ340","UDPT2BZ6E","UD1FQV38V","U017BU3UZBQ","U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"wild","count":1,"users":["U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nHu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1128276a-e2e7-4b47-8585-531af500c3e8","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"足が上がってなかったんでしょうねー。ちょろっと地面かすったらどえらいコケかたになってしまった。アスファルトでコケるとボロボロになるな。","ts":"1636632889.187600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wi2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48c1ac0a-fff8-41df-ad6e-55535014e6ce","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"普通に歩いて捻挫で２ヶ月くらい苦労したことあるので、すごい心配はしますが、とにかくおだいじに....","ts":"1636631676.185300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b5SW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72a3652a-b8ac-4a8e-a79f-d093ad974be3","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"昨日、走ってる最中にコケて出血＆擦過傷＆打撲でボロボロなんですが、今日も走ってきました。写真上げるとグロなのであげませんが。","ts":"1636631607.184000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"odaijini","count":12,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U76GA7MFA","UFUD1LS14","U017BU3UZBQ","UGEQG12HJ","U01R5R36QK0","UL6CFN8NR","UDPT2BZ6E","UDDCM376D","UD1FQV38V","U81LLJ340","U7JL1UKKL"]},{"name":"puro","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"hiee","count":1,"users":["U01HFNMNB55"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nur2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a8074b6-32ba-4a96-bb09-bbfcbe664aac","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/tokyo-metropolitan-gov/covid19/issues/6724\u003e\nワクチンからCovidの話になりますが、最近こういう事があったので供養 :totemoturai:","ts":"1636631166.182700","attachments":[{"color":"cb2431","fallback":"540x734px image","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/tokyo-metropolitan-gov/covid19/issues/6724|#6724 重症基準の注釈文言: 都の基準を明記\u003e","text":"*改善詳細 / Details of Improvement*\n\n「モニタリング項目(7) 重症患者数」の注釈文言の修正を提案します。\n\n重症基準について、都のPDFへのリンクが #5317 で提案され、 #5318 でマージされたようですが、このPDF文書を見ると現在の注釈文言である「入院患者数のうち、人工呼吸器管理（ECMOを含む）が必要な患者数を計上。」は間違っており、都のPDFの通り「人工呼吸管理または ECMO を使用している患者」と記述したほうが良いように思います。\n\n*スクリーンショット / Screenshot*\n\n\u003chttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/4703128/132290459-6e4ff0b4-c5d4-40cb-94f7-8b3779a6385a.png|image\u003e\n\n*期待する見せ方・挙動 / Expected behavior*\n\n注釈文言の変更。\n\n• before: 「入院患者数のうち、人工呼吸器管理（ECMOを含む）が必要な患者数を計上。」\n• after: 「人工呼吸管理または ECMO を使用している患者数を計上。」\n\n*動作環境・ブラウザ / Environment*\n\n• Linux\n• Chrome","image_url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/4703128/132290459-6e4ff0b4-c5d4-40cb-94f7-8b3779a6385a.png","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"improvement, officially-answered","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"5","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/tokyo-metropolitan-gov/covid19|tokyo-metropolitan-gov/covid19\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1630993521}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rF+d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe516122-9a53-4ff1-bfc8-b5115b14ee7e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ワクチンでもまあまあぐっすり","ts":"1636631127.181800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t41V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27f11066-3ce1-4c0b-bd13-8710816d707d","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あー。ワクチン。そういうイベントもありましたねー\n過ぎたことは忘れがち","ts":"1636631013.181300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nXK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24d26db4-2252-4850-b421-c9debc8d2f64","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ワクチン二回目の夜は眠れませんでしたね","ts":"1636630952.180600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":2,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+wa6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54380c8e-ef0b-4d32-bda5-e238ef0b943f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"眠れない時は諦めたほうがいいらしい（聞いた話では）","ts":"1636630917.180100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R8ivm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22d9b31b-6396-4325-acc8-f4951a4d0253","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"おふとんの中で眠れない夜を過ごす辛さよ（経験ないけど）","ts":"1636630890.179700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0SQ4Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31996733-c1fd-433a-894e-6e582e7f4459","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"おふとんの気持ちよさを味わわないなんてもったいない！","ts":"1636630785.178900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":2,"users":["U76GA7MFA","U01R5R36QK0"]},{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gfJ9h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9688f2c9-8c48-45dd-a19d-18d70077a5da","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"実際睡眠なしで40年生きるのと毎日8時間睡眠にとって80年生きるのだったら80年生きるほうがいいよなーとは思います","ts":"1636630728.177600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qXY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ebeefeb-33e2-4b6f-8684-3a0167f24f1d","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"さらに進化すると、なんとなく短命になりそうな気がする。","ts":"1636630555.176600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YOKD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5263b198-f64b-47b8-b3c4-cb5c32021ca3","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"進化するとショートスリーパーになれるのか。","ts":"1636630500.176200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1n="}]},{"client_msg_id":"66973cca-8694-45da-ab72-bca8976e975c","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"記事ちゃんと読んでないけど\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/_daichikonno/status/1456820718788775946\u003e","ts":"1636630051.175700","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/_daichikonno|@_daichikonno\u003e: 「なぜ生物は眠るのか？」という問いに対し、近年の睡眠研究の進歩を挙げながら、\n\n・むしろ睡眠の方が生命体にとってのデフォルト状態である\n・生物は睡眠を進化させたのではなく、覚醒を進化させたのではないか\n\nと問いかける記事。\n\nすごく興味深い着眼点だと感じました。\n\u003chttps://www.science.org/content/article/if-alive-sleeps-brainless-creatures-shed-light-why-we-slumber\u003e \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FDequNOakAAaK4E.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"Daichi Konno / 紺野 大地","author_subname":"@_daichikonno","author_link":"https://twitter.com/_daichikonno/status/1456820718788775946","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1359776459292700676/iP3zLhVr_normal.jpg","text":"「なぜ生物は眠るのか？」という問いに対し、近年の睡眠研究の進歩を挙げながら、\n\n・むしろ睡眠の方が生命体にとってのデフォルト状態である\n・生物は睡眠を進化させたのではなく、覚醒を進化させたのではないか\n\nと問いかける記事。\n\nすごく興味深い着眼点だと感じました。\n\u003chttps://www.science.org/content/article/if-alive-sleeps-brainless-creatures-shed-light-why-we-slumber\u003e \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FDequNOakAAaK4E.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FDequNOakAAaK4E.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1636168100,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/_daichikonno/status/1456820718788775946","original_url":"https://twitter.com/_daichikonno/status/1456820718788775946"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6PsY"}]}]
